      "cooked": "<p>So over the last year I’ve been practicing my miniature painting and I’m always looking for something fun to paint. So I’ve been looking through Reaper Miniatures looking for some stand ins for our favorite heroes. Here’s what I’ve got so far.</p>\n<p>Legacy<br>\n<a href=\"http://www.reapermini.com/OnlineStore/super/sku-down/50027#detail/50027_w_1\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">http://www.reapermini.com/OnlineStore/super/sku-down/50027#detail/50027_w_1</a></p>\n<p>Absolute Zero<br>\n<a href=\"http://www.reapermini.com/OnlineStore/super/sku-down/50107#detail/50107_w_1\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">http://www.reapermini.com/OnlineStore/super/sku-down/50107#detail/50107_w_1</a></p>\n<p>Expatriette (Needs eye patch)<br>\n<a href=\"http://www.reapermini.com/OnlineStore/Chronoscope/sku-down/50210#detail/50210_w_1\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">http://www.reapermini.com/OnlineStore/Chronoscope/sku-down/50210#detail/50210_w_1</a></p>\n<p>Bunker<br>\n<a href=\"http://www.reapermini.com/OnlineStore/Chronoscope/sku-down/50078#detail/50078_w_3\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">http://www.reapermini.com/OnlineStore/Chronoscope/sku-down/50078#detail/50078_w_3</a></p>\n<p>Can you find anymore and/or better ones?</p>",
